         .col-sm-6
          p
          strong Rewards:
         .col-sm-6
          .red Day 1–3: 500 yen × 2.5 deliveries per hour × 9h = 11,250 yen
          .red Day 4–7: 500 yen × 3 deliveries per hour × 9h = 13,500 yen (Monthly 337,500 yen)
          .red Day 7 onward: 500 yen × 4 deliveries per hour × 9h = 18,000 yen (Monthly 450,000 yen)
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
          p
          strong Working Hours:
         .col-sm-6
          | [A] 11:00–16:00 / [B] 17:00–21:00
          br/
          | *You may work only A or only B
        .row
         .col-sm-6
          p
          strong Standard Working Days:
         .col-sm-6
          | 25 days per month
          br/
          | *Part-time work is also available.
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
          p
           strong Contract Type:
         .col-sm-6
           | Outsourcing contract (Gyomu Itaku)
           br/
           | No social insurance coverage.
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
          p
          strong Work Location:
