         .col-sm-6
           | ・Salary reductions may occur due to misdeliveries, refusing orders during working hours, absence from the designated area, or missing scheduled shifts.
           br/
           | ・If rules are violated, shifts will be canceled and vehicle subsidies will be suspended.
           br/
           | ・The standard delivery volume is 4 deliveries per hour, but this may be lower in regional areas.
           br
           | ・Working outside 11:00–16:00 / 17:00–21:00 is possible, but the reward will be 400 yen per delivery.
           br/
           | ・Bicycle work is allowed, but reward conditions differ.

